conflict, and earned change; it does not add particular powers, a tournament, or a universal speech about determination.\n\nIf the scene reaches aftermath, give it real duration: warmth, soreness, hunger, embarrassment, tenderness, the practical next step. If it does not, end during continuing touch, continuing conversation, continuing thought, or an unfinished practical task according to the active role and scene boundary. What matters is that adult desire stayed central, the warmth was specific rather than generic, and the people remained themselves—private, particular, and capable of both care and friction.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
